CREATE MASTER KEY ENCRYPTION BY PASSWORD = '<strong password>';
CREATE CERTIFICATE CardCert WITH SUBJECT = 'Card protection';
CREATE SYMMETRIC KEY CardKey WITH ALGORITHM = AES_256
    ENCRYPTION BY CERTIFICATE CardCert;

OPEN SYMMETRIC KEY CardKey DECRYPTION BY CERTIFICATE CardCert;
UPDATE dbo.Cards SET CardNoEnc = ENCRYPTBYKEY(KEY_GUID('CardKey'), CardNo);
SELECT CONVERT(CHAR(16), DECRYPTBYKEY(CardNoEnc)) FROM dbo.Cards;
CLOSE SYMMETRIC KEY CardKey;
